    - target: {fileID: 7848476467226314218, guid: 605a4d433c9b7a148b997bab62d81817,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Look at this miserable storm.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7848476467226314218, guid: 605a4d433c9b7a148b997bab62d81817,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: We have to <b>do</b> something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7848476467226314218, guid: 605a4d433c9b7a148b997bab62d81817,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: The stars are watching us. They have faith in us. Even if I don't.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7848476467226314218, guid: 605a4d433c9b7a148b997bab62d81817,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: ...oh, no.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7848476467226314218, guid: 605a4d433c9b7a148b997bab62d81817,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: Edrick. We have to hurry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
